add('bisi2020','Lorenzo Bisi; Luca Sabbioni; Edoardo Vittori; Matteo Papini; Marcello Restelli','Risk-Averse Trust Region Optimization for Reward-Volatility Reduction',2020,'Proceedings of IJCAI-20, 4583–4589','https://doi.org/10.24963/ijcai.2020/632','Published proceedings PDF, saved and read.','§3 Eqs. (3)–(6); §§4–5, Algorithm 1; §7.1–7.2, Fig. 1(a)–(d).','Trading with short-term risk control.','Expected reward minus occupancy-weighted per-step reward variance.','Trading P&L minus turnover costs; policy-dependent centred quadratic transformation.','Trust Region Volatility Optimization (TRVO), extending TRPO.','Daily S&P500 through 2019; minute USD/EUR and USD/JPY, train 2017/test 2018.','Mean-volatility and mean-variance frontiers.','Fig. 1 reports broader/frontier improvements over exponential rewards; S&P results are in-sample.','Yes: reward-volatility Bellman/gradient theory and return-variance bound.','Distinguishes risk measures; does not target the terminal-MV subgame equilibrium here.','No closed-form optimum for historical tasks.','Direct prior art against broad reward-analysis novelty. We compare its per-step criterion with an independently specified terminal equilibrium; do not call its chosen short-term objective wrong.')
